WEBVTT

00:00:29.997 --> 00:00:32.397
Seeds are a bit like that too.

00:00:32.397 --> 00:00:36.997
They're tiny and densely packed
with their entire existence.

00:00:38.130 --> 00:00:41.663
Time feels different now,
while we shelter at home.

00:00:41.697 --> 00:00:44.063
Time is scary and uncertain.

00:00:44.597 --> 00:00:47.130
So we decided to plant some mint.

00:00:47.930 --> 00:00:50.730
We actually started
a little garden a while ago,

00:00:50.763 --> 00:00:52.497
but now we have more time.

00:00:53.097 --> 00:00:55.397
We thought that these flowers had died,

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:58.097
but they miraculously came back to life.

00:00:58.697 --> 00:01:01.430
A hopeful sign about the future, perhaps?